<Layout title="Open source licenses" description="Open-source credits and licenses for Reactive Resume templates, the PDF renderer, TikTok Sans, and Lato used in Resumv."><article class="page-wrap article"><div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">BUILT WITH OPEN SOURCE</span><h1>Good work builds on good work.</h1></div><h2>Reactive Resume</h2><p>Our 15 resume templates and PDF rendering engine are adapted from Reactive Resume by Amruth Pillai, under the MIT License. The complete David Kowalski sample, including its portrait, comes from the same upstream repository. We retain its content and multi-page structure, adapt the fonts for local rendering, and regenerate the previews from that data. Our browser workspace follows its content, preview, and design workflow, adapted for local-only use in Astro.</p><p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/reactive-resume/reactive-resume">View the original project ↗</a></p><p><a class="text-link" href="/licenses/reactive-resume.txt">Read the MIT License ↗</a></p><h2>Fonts</h2><p>Interface: TikTok Sans Variable. Resume option: Lato. Both are bundled locally under the SIL Open Font License.</p><p><a class="text-link" href="/licenses/tiktok-sans.txt">TikTok Sans license ↗</a></p><p><a class="text-link" href="/licenses/lato.txt">Lato license ↗</a></p></article></Layout>


